  {
   "clause": 0,
   "start_ms": 0,
   "end_ms": 3181,
   "chars": 14,
   "text": "很多人以为自律是靠意志力硬扛",
   "origStart": 0,
   "origEnd": 14
  },
  {
   "clause": 1,
   "start_ms": 3481,
   "end_ms": 4479,
   "chars": 4,
   "text": "其实不是",
   "origStart": 15,
   "origEnd": 19
  },
  {
   "clause": 2,
   "start_ms": 4779,
   "end_ms": 7403,
   "chars": 12,
   "text": "意志力是一种会消耗的资源",
   "origStart": 20,
   "origEnd": 32
  },
  {
   "clause": 3,
   "start_ms": 7703,
   "end_ms": 10420,
   "chars": 12,
   "text": "你早上用它拒绝了一次甜点",
   "origStart": 33,
   "origEnd": 45
  },
  {
   "clause": 4,
   "start_ms": 10720,
   "end_ms": 12903,
   "chars": 10,
   "text": "中午就更难拒绝第二次",
   "origStart": 46,
   "origEnd": 56
  },
  {
   "clause": 5,
   "start_ms": 13203,
   "end_ms": 15293,
   "chars": 9,
   "text": "真正能长期坚持的人",
   "origStart": 57,
   "origEnd": 66
  },
  {
   "clause": 6,
   "start_ms": 15593,
   "end_ms": 16963,
   "chars": 7,
   "text": "靠的不是意志力",
   "origStart": 67,
   "origEnd": 74
  },
  {
   "clause": 7,
   "start_ms": 17263,
   "end_ms": 19515,
   "chars": 10,
   "text": "而是把选择提前做完了",
   "origStart": 75,
   "origEnd": 85
  },
  {
   "clause": 8,
   "start_ms": 19815,
   "end_ms": 22114,
   "chars": 10,
   "text": "比如把运动鞋放在门口",
   "origStart": 86,
   "origEnd": 96
  },
  {
   "clause": 9,
   "start_ms": 22414,
   "end_ms": 24945,
   "chars": 10,
   "text": "把手机充电器放在客厅",
   "origStart": 97,
   "origEnd": 107
  },
  {
   "clause": 10,
   "start_ms": 25245,
   "end_ms": 27498,
   "chars": 9,
   "text": "把零食从冰箱里清掉",
   "origStart": 108,
   "origEnd": 117
  },
  {
   "clause": 11,
   "start_ms": 27798,
   "end_ms": 29980,
   "chars": 9,
   "text": "这些动作看起来很小",
   "origStart": 118,
   "origEnd": 127
  },
  {
   "clause": 12,
   "start_ms": 30280,
   "end_ms": 33136,
   "chars": 13,
   "text": "但它们把需要当场做决定的事",
   "origStart": 128,
   "origEnd": 141
  },
  {
   "clause": 13,
   "start_ms": 33436,
   "end_ms": 35596,
   "chars": 10,
   "text": "变成了不需要决定的事",
   "origStart": 142,
   "origEnd": 152
  },
  {
   "clause": 14,
   "start_ms": 35896,
   "end_ms": 38706,
   "chars": 13,
   "text": "所以自律的本质不是对抗自己",
   "origStart": 153,
   "origEnd": 166
  },
  {
   "clause": 15,
   "start_ms": 39006,
   "end_ms": 40399,
   "chars": 6,
   "text": "而是设计环境",
   "origStart": 167,
   "origEnd": 173
  },
  {
   "clause": 16,
   "start_ms": 40699,
   "end_ms": 43741,
   "chars": 15,
   "text": "你不需要变成一个更有意志力的人",
   "origStart": 174,
   "origEnd": 189
  },
  {
   "clause": 17,
   "start_ms": 44041,
   "end_ms": 47361,
   "chars": 15,
   "text": "你只需要让正确的选项变得更容易",
   "origStart": 190,
   "origEnd": 205
  },
  {
   "clause": 18,
   "start_ms": 47661,
   "end_ms": 50123,
   "chars": 11,
   "text": "让错误的选项变得更麻烦",
   "origStart": 206,
   "origEnd": 217
  }
 ]
}